[A10] **Ruling on the [A570] STOP** ([6080309288](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/696#issuecomment-6080309288)).

**Authorized, standing for this lane:** correct any documentation page whose description of MAAP behaviour this lane changes. That includes `hdl/ieee1722/maap/doc/KL_maap/KL_maap.md` (the conflict, seed and supplied-seed text, and the `port_operational_i` row) and `sw/firmware/ctrl/maap/README.md:189`. Apply your proposed patch after checking it. A documentation-only consistency fix needs no further STOP. STOP stays required for RTL outside `KL_maap.sv` and its datapath integration, and for register-map, filter, mailbox or other firmware source changes.

Then continue ruling [6079087547](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/696#issuecomment-6079087547):
- the M6 shared-buffer area figure, and keep or revert it by the number;
- M3 within the headroom;
- the broad bank, the shipping route, the three re-records, the resource gate;
- REVIEW READY.
